From: XEMU local matrix builder
Subject: [PATCH 60] NV2A Vulkan: bounded immutable vertex snapshots

Core renderer experiment, independent of Debug Tools. Preserve guest vertex
indices and existing finish/fence fallback; stage per-draw immutable bytes in
the existing inline arena. XEMU_VK_VERTEX_SNAPSHOTS=0 selects the stock path.

